[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0010","text":"朋友要来\n待会儿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0020","text":"…………啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0023","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0024","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0025","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0026","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0030","text":"对不起……！\n擅自看了…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0040","text":"不，没事……！\n那个，还没怎么画呢…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0050","text":"……这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0060","text":"一片漆黑，呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0070","text":"呵呵\n……是的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0080","text":"────……\n…………永远……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0090","text":"……诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0100","text":"总觉得，像宇宙一样呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0110","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0120","text":"……啊\n咦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0130","text":"…………\n打不开────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0140","text":"啊……\n这扇窗，打不开的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0150","text":"……这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0152","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0160","text":"…………打不开，才好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0170","text":"诶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0180","text":"叫做减法混色，把颜色混合起来\n最后会变成黑色"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0190","text":"画着画着，这个也不对、那个也不对的\n线条和颜色，越来越互相打架…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0200","text":"失去了意象的轮廓，\n然后就……哇地一下……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0201","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0210","text":"想用这双眼睛去看的广阔世界，却要把它关进这狭窄的框框里\n这件事，让我觉得有点可笑"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0220","text":"……是我在画，还是被画着\n为了什么，我…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0230","text":"对阳希酱来说，画画\n是那么重大的事啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0231","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0233","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0240","text":"店里有点昏暗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0250","text":"透过磨砂玻璃射进来的光和颜色，好漂亮……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0260","text":"当从窗户射进来的光，变成与平时不同的颜色时……\n我就会想象，对面的庭院里开着什么花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0270","text":"想要看到这扇窗的对面\n我希望能一直这样想着……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0271","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0272","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0280","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0290","text":"啊……\n巡，这边……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0291","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0300","text":"！\n透酱！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0301","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0310","text":"透、透酱\n久等了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0311","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0320","text":"咿……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0330","text":"…………现在录的那部动画里呢\n有一颗叫『量子之星』的，不可思议的星星"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0340","text":"只在看着的时候存在的星星\n不去看就不存在的星星"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0350","text":"对某些人来说存在\n对另一些人来说却不存在的星星"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0360","text":"阳希酱看得见的东西，冬优还看不见，\n但通过阳希酱的画，冬优也能看见了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0370","text":"如果没有阳希酱的小小宇宙，\n冬优的宇宙里，那颗星星一定就一直不存在────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0380","text":"────什么的……嘿嘿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0390","text":"…………说不定\n偶像，也是这样的存在呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0391","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0399","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0400","text":"你让那色彩展翅的理由\n不是从一开始，就在那里吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0410","text":"我只能做我自己"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0420","text":"但是…………正因如此──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0430","text":"在你仰望的，天空中"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02020000_07_0440","text":"正因为是这块画布，才有描绘的意义"}]
